_A1 = [("Isang seminar tungkol sa local legislation para sa mga Punong Barangay ang isinagawa dito kamakailan upang matukoy ang pinakamahalagang tungkulin nila bilang tagapagpatupad ng mga batas sa kanilang mga nasasakupan.", "A seminar on local legislation for the Punong Barangay was held here recently to identify their most important duty as enforcers of the laws in their jurisdictions."), ("Ang Punong Barangay ang itinuturing na pinakamakapangyarihang opisyal ng pamahalaan sa bansa.", "The Punong Barangay is regarded as the most powerful government official in the country."), ("Sa kanyang kamay natitipon ang mahahalagang tungkulin bilang tagapagpatupad ng mga batas, mga taga-gawa ng batas at tagapaghukom kaugnay sa mga idinudulog na mga problema at usapin sa barangay.", "In his hands are gathered the important duties as enforcer of laws, maker of laws and judge in connection with the problems and issues brought to the barangay."), ("Ito ay inorganisa ni Bise Gobernador Humerlito A. Dolor at ng Sangguniang Panlalawigan na dinaluhan ng mahigit apatnaraang kapitan ng barangay mula sa una at ikalawang distrito ng lalawigan.", "It was organized by Vice Governor Humerlito A. Dolor and the Sangguniang Panlalawigan and was attended by more than four hundred barangay captains from the first and second districts of the province."), ("Sa isang panayam, sinabi ni Naujan Mayor Mark Marcos na mahalaga ang tungkulin sa katarungang pambarangay dahil naiiwasan ang pagdami ng kaso.", "In an interview, Naujan Mayor Mark Marcos said that the duty in the barangay justice system is important because the increase of cases is avoided."), ("Aniya, sa barangay pa lamang ay nasosolusyunan na ang mga problema ng mga taga-barangay.", "He said that already at the barangay level the problems of the barangay residents are solved."), ("Nakakatulong ang mga kapitan na mabawasan at hindi na dumami pa ang mga kaso sa isang munisipalidad.", "The captains help reduce cases and keep them from increasing further in a municipality."), ("Sa pamamagitan ng naturang seminar, inaasahang higit na epektibong magagampanan ng mga punong barangay ang kanilang tungkulin hindi lamang bilang mga tagapagpatupad ng batas at pinaka-Huwes ng kanilang barangay, higit bilang mga kasapi ng kani-kanilang Sangguniang Barangay.", "Through the said seminar, it is expected that the punong barangay will perform their duty more effectively, not only as enforcers of the law and chief judge of their barangay, but above all as members of their respective Sangguniang Barangay.")]
_K3 = [("1. The main idea", "The passage is about a seminar on local legislation for Barangay Chairmen."), ("2. Objectives of the seminar", "The purpose of the seminar is to identify the most important responsibility of the barangay captains as enforcers of the law in their own place or jurisdiction. It is also expected that through the seminar, the barangay heads or chairs will be able to perform their duties not only as law enforcers but also as judges in their own barangay. The barangay captains are also expected to function more as members of their respective Sangguniang Barangay."), ("3. What the passage says about the Barangay Captain", "The Barangay Captain is considered the most powerful official of the government in the country. In his hands lie the duties to enforce the law, enact laws, and render judgment in relation to the problems referred to them at the barangay level."), ("4. What Mayor Marcos said about the Barangay Justice System", "Mayor Marcos said that the Barangay Justice System has an important role to play because it prevents the congestion of cases. He said the issues of the residents of the barangay are resolved at the barangay level. The barangay captains helped reduce cases in the municipality.")]
